@startuml
title 案例1: 個人送養發佈流程

actor "送養人\n(User)" as User
participant "前端\n(Frontend)" as FE
participant "後端API\n(animals.py)" as API
participant "資料庫\n(Database)" as DB
participant "MinIO\n(Object Storage)" as MinIO
participant "Notification\nService" as NS

== 步驟1: 建立動物草稿 ==
User -> FE: 填寫動物基本資料
FE -> API: POST /api/animals\n(含JWT token)
activate API

API -> API: 驗證JWT token\n取得 current_user_id
API -> DB: 查詢 User 資料
DB --> API: User 資料

API -> API: 判斷動物類型:\n- 一般會員 → owner_id\n- 收容所成員 → shelter_id
API -> DB: INSERT Animal\n(status=DRAFT)
DB --> API: animal_id

API --> FE: 201 Created\n{animal_id, status: DRAFT}
FE --> User: 顯示草稿已建立

== 步驟2: 上傳動物圖片 ==
User -> FE: 上傳動物照片
FE -> FE: 轉換圖片為 base64

loop 每張圖片
    FE -> API: POST /api/animals/{id}/images\n{image_url: base64, mime_type}
    activate API
    
    API -> API: 驗證權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
    API -> API: 解析 base64 圖片
    API -> MinIO: PUT object\n{bucket, storage_key, image_data}
    MinIO --> API: 上傳成功
    
    API -> API: 構建公開 URL
    API -> DB: INSERT AnimalImage\n{animal_id, storage_key, url, order}
    DB --> API: image_id
    
    API --> FE: 201 Created\n{image_id, url}
    deactivate API
end

FE --> User: 顯示已上傳圖片

== 步驟3: 完善動物資訊 ==
User -> FE: 編輯動物詳細資料\n(品種、年齡、描述等)
FE -> API: PATCH /api/animals/{id}\n{name, breed, description...}
activate API

API -> API: 驗證權限
API -> DB: UPDATE Animal
DB --> API: 更新成功

API --> FE: 200 OK\n{updated animal}
deactivate API
FE --> User: 資料已儲存

== 步驟4: 提交審核 ==
User -> FE: 點擊「提交審核」
FE -> API: POST /api/animals/{id}/submit
activate API

API -> API: 驗證權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id)
API -> DB: 檢查狀態 == DRAFT
API -> DB: UPDATE Animal\nstatus = SUBMITTED
DB --> API: 更新成功

API --> FE: 200 OK\n{status: SUBMITTED}
deactivate API
FE --> User: 提示「已提交審核」

== 步驟5: 管理員審核 ==
actor "管理員\n(Admin)" as Admin
Admin -> FE: 檢視待審核動物
FE -> API: GET /api/animals\n?status=SUBMITTED
API -> DB: SELECT Animals\nWHERE status = SUBMITTED
DB --> API: 動物列表
API --> FE: 待審核列表
FE --> Admin: 顯示待審核動物

Admin -> FE: 審核決定\n(通過/拒絕)

alt 審核通過
    Admin -> FE: 點擊「批准發布」
    FE -> API: POST /api/animals/{id}/publish
    activate API
    
    API -> API: 驗證管理員權限
    API -> DB: UPDATE Animal\nstatus = PUBLISHED
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    
    API --> FE: 200 OK\n{status: PUBLISHED}
    deactivate API
    FE --> Admin: 提示「已發布」
    
    note right of DB: 動物現在對外公開\n可接受領養申請

else 審核拒絕
    Admin -> FE: 點擊「拒絕」並輸入原因
    FE -> API: POST /api/animals/{id}/reject\n{rejection_reason}
    activate API
    
    API -> API: 驗證管理員權限
    API -> DB: UPDATE Animal\nstatus = DRAFT,\nrejection_reason,\nrejected_at,\nrejected_by
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    
    API --> FE: 200 OK\n{status: DRAFT}
    deactivate API
    FE --> Admin: 提示「已拒絕」
    
    note right of User: 送養人可查看拒絕原因\n並修改後重新提交
end




title 案例2: 領養申請提交流程

actor "申請人\n(Applicant)" as Applicant
actor "送養人\n(Owner)" as Owner
participant "前端\n(Frontend)" as FE
participant "後端API\n(applications.py)" as API
participant "資料庫\n(Database)" as DB
participant "Notification\nService" as NS
participant "Celery\nWorker" as Celery
participant "Email\nService" as Email

== 步驟1: 瀏覽動物資訊 ==
Applicant -> FE: 瀏覽可領養動物
FE -> API: GET /api/animals\n?status=PUBLISHED
API -> DB: SELECT Animals\nWHERE status = PUBLISHED
DB --> API: 動物列表
API --> FE: 已發布動物列表
FE --> Applicant: 顯示可領養動物

== 步驟2: 查看動物詳情 ==
Applicant -> FE: 點擊動物卡片
FE -> API: GET /api/animals/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT Animal\nWITH images, owner
DB --> API: 動物詳細資訊
API --> FE: {animal, images, owner_info}
FE --> Applicant: 顯示動物詳情頁

== 步驟3: 填寫申請表單 ==
Applicant -> FE: 點擊「申請領養」
FE --> Applicant: 顯示申請表單

Applicant -> FE: 填寫申請資料:\n- 聯絡電話\n- 地址\n- 職業\n- 居住環境\n- 飼養經驗\n- 領養原因
FE -> FE: 驗證表單完整性

== 步驟4: 提交申請 ==
Applicant -> FE: 點擊「提交申請」
FE -> API: POST /api/applications\n(含JWT token)\n{animal_id, contact_phone,\ncontact_address, occupation,\nhousing_type, has_experience,\nreason, notes}
activate API

API -> API: 驗證JWT token\n取得 applicant_id

API -> API: 檢查用戶角色\n(只有一般會員可申請)
alt 非一般會員
    API --> FE: 403 Forbidden\n「只有一般會員可提出領養申請」
    FE --> Applicant: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 是一般會員
    
    API -> DB: SELECT Animal\nWHERE animal_id = ?
    DB --> API: Animal 資料
    
    API -> API: 檢查動物狀態\n(必須是 PUBLISHED)
    alt 動物已被領養或未發布
        API --> FE: 400 Bad Request\n「此動物目前無法申請領養」
        FE --> Applicant: 顯示錯誤訊息
    else 動物可申請
        
        API -> API: 檢查申請人 != 刊登者
        alt 申請人是刊登者本人
            API --> FE: 400 Bad Request\n「不能申請自己刊登的動物」
            FE --> Applicant: 顯示錯誤訊息
        else 非本人
            
            API -> DB: SELECT Application\nWHERE animal_id = ?\nAND status IN (PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW)
            DB --> API: 查詢結果
            
            alt 已有其他人的待審核申請
                API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n「此動物有待審核申請」
                FE --> Applicant: 提示等待
            else 可以申請
                
                API -> DB: SELECT Application\nWHERE animal_id = ?\nAND applicant_id = ?\nAND status IN (PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW, APPROVED)
                DB --> API: 查詢結果
                
                alt 已提交過申請
                    API --> FE: 409 Conflict\n「已對此動物提交申請」
                    FE --> Applicant: 提示重複申請
                else 首次申請
                    
                    API -> DB: INSERT Application\n(animal_id, applicant_id,\nstatus=PENDING,\nsubmitted_at=NOW(),\ncontact_phone, address,\noccupation, housing_type,\nhas_experience, reason)
                    DB --> API: application_id
                    
                    API -> DB: COMMIT
                    
                    API --> FE: 201 Created\n{application_id, status: PENDING}
                    deactivate API
                    FE --> Applicant: 「申請已提交」
                    
                    == 步驟5: 發送通知 ==
                    API -> NS: notify_application_submitted(\napplication, applicant_name, animal_name)
                    activate NS
                    
                    NS -> DB: 查詢動物擁有者\n(owner_id 或 shelter primary_account_user_id)
                    DB --> NS: recipient_id
                    
                    NS -> DB: INSERT Notification\n(recipient_id, type='application_submitted',\nactor_id=applicant_id,\npayload={application_id, animal_name})
                    DB --> NS: notification_id
                    
                    NS --> API: 通知已建立
                    deactivate NS
                    
                    note right of Owner: 送養人收到通知\n可在前端查看
                end
            end
        end
    end
end

== 步驟6: 送養人審核申請 ==
Owner -> FE: 登入並查看通知
FE -> API: GET /api/notifications
API -> DB: SELECT Notifications\nWHERE recipient_id = owner_id
DB --> API: 通知列表
API --> FE: 通知列表
FE --> Owner: 顯示「新的領養申請」

Owner -> FE: 點擊通知\n查看申請詳情
FE -> API: GET /api/applications/{id}
API -> DB: SELECT Application\nWITH applicant, animal
DB --> API: 申請完整資訊
API --> FE: {application, applicant_info,\nanimal_info}
FE --> Owner: 顯示申請詳情

Owner -> FE: 審核決定

alt 核准申請
    Owner -> FE: 點擊「核准」
    FE -> API: POST /api/applications/{id}/review\n{action: 'approve'}
    activate API
    
    API -> API: 驗證權限\n(owner_id == current_user_id\nOR 收容所成員)
    API -> DB: UPDATE Application\nstatus = APPROVED,\nreviewed_at = NOW(),\nassignee_id = owner_id,\nversion++
    
    API -> DB: UPDATE Animal\nstatus = ADOPTED
    
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    
    API -> NS: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, owner_id,\nstatus='APPROVED')
    activate NS
    
    NS -> DB: INSERT Notification\n(recipient_id=applicant_id,\ntype='application_approved')
    deactivate NS
    
    API -> Celery: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\napplicant_email, animal_name,\nstatus='approved',\ncontact_info={owner/shelter})
    activate Celery
    
    Celery -> Email: 發送核准通知郵件\n(包含送養人聯絡資訊)
    Email --> Applicant: 📧 領養申請已通過
    deactivate Celery
    
    API --> FE: 200 OK\n{status: APPROVED}
    deactivate API
    FE --> Owner: 「已核准申請」
    
    note right of Applicant: 申請人收到通知和郵件\n可聯絡送養人安排見面

else 拒絕申請
    Owner -> FE: 點擊「拒絕」\n並輸入原因
    FE -> API: POST /api/applications/{id}/review\n{action: 'reject',\nreview_notes: '原因'}
    activate API
    
    API -> API: 驗證權限
    API -> DB: UPDATE Application\nstatus = REJECTED,\nreviewed_at = NOW(),\nreview_notes,\nassignee_id = owner_id,\nversion++
    DB --> API: 更新成功
    
    API -> NS: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, owner_id,\nstatus='REJECTED')
    activate NS
    
    NS -> DB: INSERT Notification\n(recipient_id=applicant_id,\ntype='application_rejected')
    deactivate NS
    
    API -> Celery: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\napplicant_email, animal_name,\nstatus='rejected',\nmessage=review_notes)
    activate Celery
    
    Celery -> Email: 發送拒絕通知郵件
    Email --> Applicant: 📧 領養申請未通過
    deactivate Celery
    
    API --> FE: 200 OK\n{status: REJECTED}
    deactivate API
    FE --> Owner: 「已拒絕申請」
    
    note right of Applicant: 申請人收到通知\n可查看拒絕原因
    note right of DB: 動物狀態保持 PUBLISHED\n其他人可繼續申請
end
@enduml